        "teacherMoves": "Say: \"What did we learn today that helps with Mr Otieno's driving question, and what are you still wondering?\" Give WAIT TIME of 10 seconds, then ask each group to submit one question. Cold-call 2 groups to read their questions aloud. Group the slips under headings: 'angle and ratio', 'finding ratios', 'finding heights'. Point to a slip like 'How do we get ratios for other angles?' and say: \"We will answer that in Lesson 3.\"",
