      "skills": "• Calculate ratios of tabulated values and compare them with the tan column, rounding to 4 d.p.\n• Describe trends in a table of values and give a reason from the triangle (SEP: analysing and interpreting data; using mathematics)\n• Work in a group and reason from tabulated values to generalise a relationship, then justify it from the definitions",
