        "formativeAssessment": "Check each group's model for the link angle -> ratio -> length and for correct triangles with labelled sides 1, 1, root2 and 1, root3, 2. Use the exit ticket: Meets means sin 45° = cos 45° = 1/root2 (0.7071), tan 45° = 1, from the isosceles right-angled triangle. Group learners needing support for revisiting the 30° and 60° triangle."
